ttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kQBgfvCyxMWImDmodtwE8og8RADE79Zy\n\n御検討よろしくお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nanas_127/works/69", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1e88f45/uploads/origins/92d8b9cc-2af7-4b64-87bf-f92b6af34094?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7296413d18ef1136ce95b77a76e98497", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f1e88f45/uploads/origins/92d8b9cc-2af7-4b64-87bf-f92b6af34094?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7296413d18ef1136ce95b77a76e98497, https://si.imgix.net/f1e88f45/uploads/origins/92d8b9cc-2af7-4b64-87bf-f92b6af34094?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88e203f8046edde689295dab41aa30c3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f1e88f45/uploads/origins/92d8b9cc-2af7-4b64-87bf-f92b6af34094?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fcb3f679635ad23caa0cc3b5bb0087f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの絵が大好きなので、私のキャラクターを興奮した表情とポーズで描いてほしいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18dPD_RBezeQT3cFVdrEDaK9FOGgp39vQ?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nanas_127/works/68", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1ac6be07/uploads/origins/2bc1bd32-bb3f-48c4-9b73-c8fda8764a77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cbf0683df0e24ec9efab6a0bbd72ac55", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1ac6be07/uploads/origins/2bc1bd32-bb3f-48c4-9b73-c8fda8764a77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cbf0683df0e24ec9efab6a0bbd72ac55, https://si.imgix.net/1ac6be07/uploads/origins/2bc1bd32-bb3f-48c4-9b73-c8fda8764a77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd6fddbbf86323154d313fb6bd6e7079 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1ac6be07/uploads/origins/2bc1bd32-bb3f-48c4-9b73-c8fda8764a77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=to